become **12**\n3. index into `k_clTable[cLevel]`:\n\n| level | strat | internal compressor | nbSearches | targetLength | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 0 | (unreachable, remapped to 9) | — | 2 | 16 | table entry exists but level 0 → 9 |\n| 1 | `lz4mid` | `LZ4MID_compress` | 2 | 16 | reachable (only via explicit level 1) |\n| 2 | `lz4mid` | `LZ4MID_compress` | 2 | 16 | == LZ4HC_CLEVEL_MIN |\n| 3 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 4 | 16 | patternAnalysis=0 |\n| 4 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 8 | 16 | patternAnalysis=0 |\n| 5 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 16 | 16 | patternAnalysis=0 |\n| 6 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 32 | 16 | patternAnalysis=0 |\n| 7 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 64 | 16 | patternAnalysis=0 |\n| 8 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 128 | 16 | patternAnalysis=**0** (test is strict `nbSearches > 128`) |\n| 9 | `lz4hc` | `LZ4HC_compress_hashChain` | 256 | 16 | patternAnalysis=**1**; default level |\n| 10 | `lz4opt` | `LZ4HC_compress_optimal` | 96 | 64 | fullUpdate=0; chainSwap=1, patternAnalysis=1 always |\n| 11 | `lz4opt` | `LZ4HC_compress_optimal` | 512 | 128 | fullUpdate=0 |\n| 12 | `lz4opt` | `LZ4HC_compress_optimal` | 16384 | `LZ4_OPT_NUM`=4096 | fullUpdate=**1** (`cLevel >= LZ4HC_CLEVEL_MAX`); `sufficient_len` clamped to 4095 |\n\n`LZ4_setCompressionLevel` applies the same clamps (`<1 → 9`, `>12 → 12`) at set time.\n`HCfavor_e` (from `LZ4_favorDecompressionSpeed`) is only ever passed to `LZ4HC_compress_optimal`/`LZ4HC_FindLongerMatch` — so favorDecSpeed is a **no-op below level 10**.\n\n**lz4frame.c** uses a *different* split point, `LZ4HC_CLEVEL_MIN == 2`:\n\n- `compressionLevel < 2` → `ctxTypeID = 1` → `LZ4_stream_t` (fast codec). `acceleration = (level < 0) ? -level + 1 : 1`. So level 0 **and** level 1 both give acceleration 1; level -1 → 2; level -16 → 17.\n- `compressionLevel >= 2` → `ctxTypeID = 2` → `LZ4_streamHC_t`, and the level is handed to lz4hc, so **frame level 2 → lz4m